Set FontSize 14
Set Width 900
Set Height 550
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Type "pip install wiply -q && wiply start 'Building wiply'"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3000ms

Type "wiply start 'Review code'"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Type "wiply status"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2000ms

Type "wiply stop"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1500ms

Type "wiply stats"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2000ms
